### ClimateTrust REST API Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog

### 3. Footprint Calculator
POST {{baseUrl}}/footprint
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "electricityKwh": 1200,
  "fuelLiters": 450,
  "freightTkm": 2500
}

### 4. Register a New Project Parcel
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Souss Valley Argan Regeneration",
  "owner": "Cooperative Feminine Argane",
  "methodology": "VM0042 - Improved Agricultural Land Management",
  "geojson": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [
      [
        [-9.50, 30.30],
        [-9.35, 30.30],
        [-9.35, 30.45],
        [-9.50, 30.45],
        [-9.50, 30.30]
      ]
    ]
  },
  "pddHash": "0xabcdef9876543210abcdef9876543210abcdef9876543210abcdef9876543210",
  "pricePerTonneUsd": 30.0
}

### 5. Overlap Test (Should Return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Overlapping Duplicate Parcel",
  "owner": "Malicious Actor",
  "methodology": "VM0042",
  "geojson": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [
      [
        [-9.50, 30.30],
        [-9.35, 30.30],
        [-9.35, 30.45],
        [-9.50, 30.45],
        [-9.50, 30.30]
      ]
    ]
  },
  "pddHash": "0x1111222233334444"
}

### 6. Run dMRV Satellite Analysis
# Replace :id with project ID returned from createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj_kroumirie_draft/analyze

### 7. Auditor Certification & Minting (VC + HTS Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj_kroumirie_draft/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auditorId": "auditor_demo",
  "approve": true,
  "netTonnage": 40,
  "bufferPct": 15.0,
  "notes": "Verified biomass density against Sentinel-2 L2A optical imagery."
}

### 8. Place Order (Lock Serials for 15 Minutes)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": "buyer_demo",
  "projectId": "proj_atlas_cedar",
  "quantity": 3
}

### 9. Settle Payment & Retire Serials (HTS Token Wipe)
# Replace with orderId from step 8
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/ord_test123/pay

### 10. Download Retirement PDF Certificate
# Replace with orderId
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ord_test123/certificate

### 11. Public Explorer - Project Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/explorer/project/proj_atlas_cedar

### 12. Public Explorer - Serial Status (Wipe Verification)
GET {{baseUrl}}/explorer/serial/0.0.300101/1
